Author: pye <pentative@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon May 25 10:35:27 2026 +0000

    fix(reviewer-dispatch-hardening/T8): extend hermesDone to include blocked+pr_url

    When Hermes writes blocked:tests_failed with a pr_url, Phase 6 previously
    only short-circuited for in_review status. commitAndPush would return false
    (nothing new to push) and the wrapper would overwrite the real result with
    blocked:no_changes, losing the PR URL. Extend the hermesDone predicate to
    also accept blocked+pr_url so the wrapper respects Hermes's written result.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

